zash (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package: Meson/Ninja build, libzash shared library, zash(1)
    driver (interactive shell and -c), man page, bash-completion.
  * Upstream: flex/bison grammar, interpreter with pipelines, functions,
    alias, PS1 expansion.

